  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HIF Dissemination Grant 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of our dissemination activities is to increase awareness, uptake, and policy engagement around the Faircap household water filter innovation. We aim to:  (1) share practical results with national WASH stakeholders in Niger;                 (2) promote community-level learning through visual storytelling;  (3) contribute to global WASH dialogue by presenting at the International Water conference in Senegal;  (4) strengthen local ownership through engagement with authorities and partners; and  (5) support future scaling by documenting and sharing lessons learned.</narrative>
  </description>
